    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSuperb three bedroom semi-detached family home situated in a highly popular residential development offering easy access to the M1 Motorway, Dundalk Town Centre and a wealth of shopping and recreational amenities.Presented in excellent condition with modern finishes throughout, the new kitchen and bathroom present a homely and tasteful finish. Accommodation includes a sitting room, kitchen/dining room, three bedrooms and a bathroom. This exceptional home benefits from being the end house with additional garden space, overlooking a green amenity area, no passing traffic and additional guset parking opposite. The residence is further complimented by a high-end CCTV, intruder and fire alarm system. Neatly tucked away in this prime cul du sac position, this quality home benefits from a large corner site. The property also benefits from having full planning permission granted with conditions under planning ref 25/96 for a ground floor extension to the rear and a first floor extension to the side gable. Viewers will be instantly impressed with the fine finish this home exudes!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGROUND FLOOR - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - \n\n\nLiving Room - 4.4m x 3.0m\n\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 5.0m x 3.5m\n\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nMaster Bedroom - 3.1m x 3.0m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.5m x 2.1m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.6m x 3.1m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.9m x 2.2m\n\n\n - \nTOTAL FLOOR AREA: 851 sq.ft. (79.1 sq.m.) approx.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Off street parking</li><li>Side pedestrian access</li><li>Cul du sac location</li><li>Ajacent large green space</li><li>High-end CCTV, intruder & fire alarm system</ul>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C\nBER No: 107827859\nEnergy Performance Indicator: 152.38 (kWh/m2/yr)"
      },
